    "summary": "- Seat limits are enforced in the store under its lock, so invites, role changes and plan changes can't race past them. Free allows 3 seats, team 10, business unlimited. Viewers don't count.\n- POST /v1/invites and PATCH /v1/members/{user_id} return 402 `{\"error\":\"seat_limit_reached\",\"limit\",\"used\"}` when no seat is free. PATCH /v1/org returns 409 `{\"error\":\"over_seat_limit\",\"limit\",\"used\"}` and changes nothing when the new plan is too small. Accepting an invite never checks seats.\n- GET /v1/org includes `\"seats\": {\"used\", \"limit\"}`, with `limit` null when unlimited. `go build ./...`, `go vet .\n...[truncated]",
